# EXP-22: Apriori and FP-Growth Algorithm in WEKA

======================================================================
  EXPERIMENT 22: ASSOCIATION RULE MINING USING WEKA (APRIORI & FP-GROWTH)
======================================================================

1. OBJECTIVE:
   To perform Association Rule Mining on Customer Transaction Data using 
   WEKA Data Mining Software by executing Apriori and FP-Growth algorithms.

