3. WEKA EXPLORER & CLI EXECUTION STEPS:
   a. Open WEKA Explorer -> Preprocess tab -> Open file: transactions_exp22.arff
   b. Go to Associate tab.
   c. Choose Associate Scheme:
      - Apriori: weka.associations.Apriori -N 10 -C 0.5 -M 0.3 -lowerBoundMinSupport 0.3
      - FP-Growth: weka.associations.FPGrowth -N 10 -C 0.5 -M 0.3
   d. Click Start to generate frequent itemsets and association rules.

